# Changelog

All notable changes to the **Gossip Analytics Unity SDK** will be documented in this file.

This project follows **Semantic Versioning** (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH):
- MAJOR: breaking changes
- MINOR: new functionality (backward compatible)
- PATCH: bug fixes / documentation / internal improvements (backward compatible)

---

